# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip Learn the flight path from Devrak on the tower platform. The Crossroads' own quests come after Silverpine Forest, in the Barrens guide.
  getfp "Crossroads"

step To Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From the Crossroads follow the road north-east to Far Watch Post, cross the Southfury River into Durotar and keep north to Orgrimmar's main gate. The next guide starts in Orgrimmar: Thrall takes Welcome to Azeroth, and the zeppelin leaves for Tirisfal Glades and Silverpine Forest.
  goto 55.6,72.3 "Orgrimmar's main gate"
